title: "Ward-relevant IMU transition recognition — analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and reproduction notebook for a public-data feasibility
  benchmark of gyroscope-dependent recognition of ward bed-exit transitions
  from a waist-worn six-axis inertial measurement unit.
